name tamefloats
category Package
revision 27345
shortdesc Experimentally use \holdinginserts with LaTeX floats
relocated 1
longdesc LaTeX's figures, tables, and \marginpars are dangerous for
longdesc footnotes (and probably also \enlargethispage). Here is a
longdesc proposal (a 'patch' package) to help, by using \holdinginserts
longdesc in a simple way. It replaces the original problem with a new
longdesc one -- it is an experiment to find out whether the new problem
longdesc is less bad (or it is just a contribution to the discussion,
longdesc maybe just a summary of previous work). The files provide
longdesc further information.
runfiles size=3
